Third-party components
======================

ALCHEMI conformer path (GPU, engine="alchemi")
----------------------------------------------
The ALCHEMI conformer path uses the NVIDIA ALCHEMI Toolkit (Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/NVIDIA/nvalchemi-toolkit).

The interatomic potential is MACE-MPA-0 (MIT,
https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace-foundations), via mace-torch (MIT). The
Toolkit's Apache-2.0 does not extend to the potential, which carries its own
MIT license.

CPU QM engines (xtb / CREST)
----------------------------
The default CPU conformer/QM path uses xtb and CREST (GFN-xTB semiempirical
quantum chemistry), which are distributed under the LGPL-3.0 license
(https://github.com/grimme-lab/xtb, https://github.com/crest-lab/crest).
